WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.473 --> 00:00:04.419
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:09.292
Do you have a lyric?

00:00:09.292 --> 00:00:11.000
Right here, but they're not finished yet.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.917
Come on.

00:00:12.917 --> 00:00:15.731
[MUSIC CONTINUES]

00:00:16.669 --> 00:00:17.800
(RAPPING) Come on, girl.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.120
You know how much I want you.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.220
Like a ghost, I'm going to haunt you.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.180
Meet me at me crib.

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.260
Bring your friends.

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:25.540
Maybe we can drive a Mercedes Benz.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:27.730
We'll hang out poolside, have a drink.

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:29.920
Swimming against the tide, not going to sink.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:30.790
Come on, girl.

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:31.990
Let's get in trouble.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:34.150
Shaken not stirred, the James Bond from Dublin.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:37.540
What's it called?

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:41.730
"Dublin 07," like James Bond but Dublin.

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:42.850
Yeah.

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.440
You need a better title.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:47.196
Let me try something here.

00:00:47.196 --> 00:00:49.690
(SINGING) We got something real.

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:51.730
(RAPPING) I'm the joker with the Glasgow smile.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:53.860
Ready to die for you, I go in style.

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.230
Dressed from head to toe in Italian.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:59.250
In the bed, I'm like a stallion.

